  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of test sensitivity (%) in two head-to-head studies (Starshinova 2019 (a) and Starshinova 2018) for four tests, with random-effects pooled estimates: TST 5mm 88.24% (78.20–94.01), IGRA (QFT) 89.66% (78.83–95.28), IGRA (T-SPOT.TB) 90.91% (79.95–96.16) and Diaskintest 5mm 91.18% (81.72–95.98). Heterogeneity is I² = 0% for each test.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
